      "created_at": "2015-02-20T17:14:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Greetings all!</p><p>A project a year in the making, The Game Shelf, is finally on <a href=\"http://www.tinyurl.com/thegameshelf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">KickStarter</a>!</p><p>I have poured my heart and soul into this project and everything I've done to promote Sentinels and board gaming, as a whole, as been to bring this business to life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have spent hundreds of hours getting folks excited about board games that they can play at The Game Shelf.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Even if you don't plan on visiting Central Florida there are pledge levels for you!</p><p>Please check us out and help make our dream a reality everyone can enjoy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>www.tinyurl.com/thegameshelf</p><p>PS Sentinels events every month!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:51.914Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
