      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Greetings all!</p><p>A project a year in the making, The Game Shelf, is finally on <a href=\"http://www.tinyurl.com/thegameshelf\">KickStarter</a>!</p><p>I have poured my heart and soul into this project and everything I&#39;ve done to promote Sentinels and board gaming, as a whole, as been to bring this business to life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have spent hundreds of hours getting folks excited about board games that they can play at The Game Shelf.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Even if you don&#39;t plan on visiting Central Florida there are pledge levels for you!</p><p>Please check us out and help make our dream a reality everyone can enjoy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>www.tinyurl.com/thegameshelf</p><p>PS Sentinels events every month!</p>",
